00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.850
hundred and thirty one million people.

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:42.850
It's terrible.

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:43.850
It's pathetic.

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:44.850
It's horrifying.

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.530
And we'll talk about the anti back stuff in
