00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:52.810
We are now starting to see a slight uptick
once again, back up to about one point one

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:55.290
million vaccine doses per day.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:04:03.560
So there will hopefully now be the more reluctant
people who will start to realize maybe my

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:09.520
