00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:25.540
stadium and maybe that will encourage people
to go and get themselves vaccinated.

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:30.930
Whatever the case, one million vaccine doses
a day just isn't good when we still have so

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:36.160
many tens of millions upon tens of millions
of people who could go and get a vaccine.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:37.430
These are widely available.

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:40.060
There are countries desperate to get vaccines.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.470
We have so many.

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:45.680
And yet one fifth of the population by last
count just isn't interested.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:51.750
Now, one thing that does seem like it will
convince people maybe will be full FDA approval

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:58.900
of the vaccines, the the unvaccinated population,
one third of that.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:06.260
Population says, I will be going to get a
vaccine once the FDA fully approves the vaccines,

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:11.150
remember right now they're approved under
an emergency use authorization, not full approval.

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:17.910
So I would love to believe that as soon as
that approval comes one third of the vaccine,

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.350
hesitant folks will go and get vaccinated.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:22.700
I can't say I'm convinced.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:26.400
I think it's something that many of them are
saying right now.

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:30.880
And then once that full approval comes down,
they're going to come up with something else.

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:34.620
Now, I also just disagree with the premise
